{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#card-zh","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH BTW 是面向 DSH 网页聊天的侧边提问助手，可在主 Agent 工作时单独发起问题。它注册 /btw 命令，并在输入框上方显示可折叠的回答面板。用户可以查看会话问答记录、翻页、复制或删除答案，也能选择用于侧问的模型；插件会整理当前会话历史作为上下文，并在瞬时模型错误时自动重试。适合希望不中断主对话、快速追问当前任务或一般问题的 DSH 网页用户。需要 DSH 已配置可用的语言模型；不要求单独配置插件密钥。问答记录和模型选择保存在用户本机的 DSH 存储目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:438-513","lib/client.js:380-658"]}
{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#card-en","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH BTW adds side questions to DSH web chat. Use /btw while the main agent runs; answers appear in a dock above the composer. Browse, copy, delete, or retry answers and choose a model. Recent session history can provide context. A configured DSH language model is required; history is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:438-513","lib/client.js:380-658"]}
