{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#feature-1","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH BTW 的功能「后台侧问」：输入 /btw 和问题后，命令立即返回，问题在后台生成答案，不等待主 Agent 完成当前工作。输入为自然语言问题，结果进入侧问历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:492-513","lib/index.js:438-486"]}
{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#feature-2","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH BTW 的功能「会话上下文回答」：侧问调用当前会话模型，并把近期对话整理为上下文，便于询问正在处理的任务。若会话没有可用模型，也可使用已配置模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:151-217","lib/index.js:234-299","lib/index.js:363-405"]}
{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#feature-3","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH BTW 的功能「侧问记录面板」：网页输入框上方显示问题和回答，可展开或折叠、翻看较早记录、复制答案、删除记录或关闭面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:457-658"]}
{"unit_id":"WLV-ZEDD__dsh-btw#feature-4","repo":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-btw","commit":"c8febb9b87a3ab3ce1b4c2a3c067e6ed8810ef9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH BTW 的功能「瞬时错误重试」：模型请求遇到可恢复的服务错误时，会按递增间隔最多自动重试五次，并在面板显示重试进度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:406-435","lib/client.js:104-145"]}
